1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 11=

8
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:51,000
I think my leg is broken.

9
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:54,100
Miss, could you come give me a hand?

10
00:00:54,899 --> 00:00:55,899
Sure.

11
00:01:01,039 --> 00:01:02,320
I'm really sorry.

12
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,799
My husband told me

13
00:01:04,260 --> 00:01:05,859
that no matter what happens,

14
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:07,819
I must not step outside this courtyard.

15
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,599
(The gate is the barrier's edge.)

16
00:01:12,219 --> 00:01:15,099
(Zhao Dong is definitely a cultivator.)

17
00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:20,260
Help me.

18
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:22,319
I might have internal injuries too.

19
00:01:26,019 --> 00:01:28,019
Please get up.

20
00:01:30,359 --> 00:01:32,280
My husband knows some medicine.

21
00:01:44,420 --> 00:01:47,819
Tell me everything about Zhao Dong,
every last detail.

22
00:01:56,540 --> 00:01:59,200
Boss, he's Zhao Laizi,
the one who killed Xu.

23
00:02:04,299 --> 00:02:05,299
My lord,

24
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:09,460
this is Zhao Dong, Master Zhao,
who saved my father

25
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,680
the other day.

26
00:02:16,860 --> 00:02:18,580
Master Zhang is a man of great virtue

27
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:19,879
and lifelong benevolence.

28
00:02:20,479 --> 00:02:22,960
But his later years
were plagued by chronic illness.

29
00:02:23,259 --> 00:02:24,680
Your medical skills are miraculous,

30
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,960
saving him from torment.

31
00:02:27,060 --> 00:02:28,259
I truly admire you.

32
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:31,159
You flatter me, my lord.

33
00:02:31,219 --> 00:02:32,379
The ritual is about to begin.

34
00:02:32,919 --> 00:02:35,539
We shall talk more
another day, Master Zhao.

35
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:37,300
Sure.

36
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:47,840
The magistrate seems gentle

37
00:02:47,900 --> 00:02:48,900
and dignified

38
00:02:49,139 --> 00:02:50,259
and carries no arrogant air.

39
00:02:57,479 --> 00:02:58,500
Why so quiet?

40
00:02:59,259 --> 00:03:00,259
Are you jealous?

41
00:03:01,939 --> 00:03:03,020
I'm not jealous.

42
00:03:04,020 --> 00:03:05,020
It's just that

43
00:03:06,340 --> 00:03:07,659
he's going to die soon.

44
00:03:11,379 --> 00:03:12,719
Evil gathers at his brow.

45
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,240
His life line is severed.

46
00:03:15,539 --> 00:03:18,080
A faint blue shadow lingers
at the root of his nose,

47
00:03:19,319 --> 00:03:21,419
a sign of a fatal romantic entanglement.

48
00:03:27,599 --> 00:03:28,719
His love star has fallen,

49
00:03:30,039 --> 00:03:31,159
and sorrow looms above.

50
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:35,020
The longing buried deep in his eyes

51
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,740
is a love debt from a past life.

52
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:40,000
He will perish within ten days.

53
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,680
Impossible.

54
00:03:43,979 --> 00:03:45,699
His fortune is at its height,

55
00:03:45,939 --> 00:03:47,659
promising a great future ahead.

56
00:03:47,780 --> 00:03:48,780
Exactly.

57
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,639
The magistrate looks so radiant.

58
00:03:51,759 --> 00:03:53,020
He won't die young.

59
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:56,120
The hour has arrived.

60
00:03:56,699 --> 00:03:58,439
Welcome the immortal master.

61
00:04:13,439 --> 00:04:15,360
(She carries such
a heavy sinister aura.)

62
00:04:15,979 --> 00:04:17,279
(A dark cultivator, no doubt.)

63
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:20,240
Why is the master a woman?

64
00:04:20,579 --> 00:04:22,579
She reeks of heresy.
Can she really do it?

65
00:04:22,579 --> 00:04:24,660
Exactly. Are we being scammed?

66
00:04:25,100 --> 00:04:27,060
Right, is she capable?

67
00:04:27,060 --> 00:04:28,060
Silence!

68
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:40,680
(This man has such
powerful life essence.)

69
00:04:40,980 --> 00:04:41,980
(If I absorb him,)

70
00:04:42,319 --> 00:04:44,519
(my cultivation will advance
by leaps and bounds.)

71
00:04:44,839 --> 00:04:46,500
(If she can serve me,)

72
00:04:47,079 --> 00:04:49,339
(I might not have to rely
on that scoundrel Zhao Dong.)

73
00:04:58,839 --> 00:05:01,060
Has someone stolen your soul, Dong?

74
00:05:02,339 --> 00:05:03,680
Far more than that.

75
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:06,060
She wants to devour me whole.

76
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:12,500
Today, I need a drop of blood
from each of you

77
00:05:13,279 --> 00:05:15,120
to offer into this Spirit Bowl

78
00:05:15,620 --> 00:05:17,100
to show our sincere devotion.

79
00:05:17,579 --> 00:05:19,259
Only then can our prayers reach Heaven

80
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,000
and bring down rain.

81
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:23,079
To end this drought,

82
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:25,639
I shall be the first to offer mine.

83
00:05:37,819 --> 00:05:40,160
The magistrate
truly cares for the people.

84
00:05:40,420 --> 00:05:41,819
Heaven will surely witness this.

85
00:05:43,139 --> 00:05:44,139
Next.

86
00:05:44,259 --> 00:05:45,980
Do we have to offer blood too?

87
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:48,560
Of course. Why not?

88
00:06:03,259 --> 00:06:05,439
(What surging vital energy.)

89
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:07,040
(This aura...)

90
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:10,279
(I can barely suppress my own cravings.)

91
00:06:25,439 --> 00:06:27,079
The devotion is complete.

92
00:06:27,879 --> 00:06:29,199
Spirits, heed my call!

93
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:30,800
By the sacred law!

94
00:06:48,879 --> 00:06:50,220
Follow me

95
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:52,220
inside.

96
00:06:53,860 --> 00:06:54,860
Yes.

97
00:07:15,759 --> 00:07:18,199
Such pure yang essence.

98
00:07:19,100 --> 00:07:20,839
You are a heaven-given
cultivation vessel.

99
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:28,560
Once I harvest you,

100
00:07:28,860 --> 00:07:31,040
I will surely break through
to the Nascent Soul stage.

101
00:07:32,540 --> 00:07:35,019
Tell me, am I beautiful?

102
00:07:37,699 --> 00:07:38,759
You're not just beautiful

103
00:07:39,620 --> 00:07:40,759
but also seductive.

104
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:49,360
Captivated by my spell,

105
00:07:49,759 --> 00:07:51,639
you naturally speak the truth.

106
00:07:52,459 --> 00:07:55,319
Who knew you could be so fun?

107
00:07:58,300 --> 00:07:59,399
Don't worry.

108
00:07:59,839 --> 00:08:03,339
I'll take you to the heights of ecstasy

109
00:08:05,220 --> 00:08:08,139
before draining every drop
of your yang essence,

110
00:08:09,519 --> 00:08:12,759
plunging you
from heaven straight to earth.

111
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:24,699
What a venomous woman you are.

112
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,920
Of course.

113
00:08:29,079 --> 00:08:30,079
You're still lucid?

114
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,000
What happened?

115
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:54,440
These two aren't immortal masters.

116
00:08:54,919 --> 00:08:55,919
They're dark cultivators.

117
00:08:56,159 --> 00:08:57,799
She collected all your blood

118
00:08:58,100 --> 00:08:59,500
to put you under her control

119
00:08:59,779 --> 00:09:02,159
and drain your life essence

120
00:09:02,159 --> 00:09:03,159
for her own cultivation.

121
00:09:04,039 --> 00:09:06,759
Unluckily for her, she ran into me.

122
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:09,600
With a simple wave,
I exposed her true colors.

123
00:09:09,899 --> 00:09:10,899
Really?

124
00:09:13,740 --> 00:09:14,740
Sir,

125
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,639
I'm willing to spend my vital energy
to summon rain.

126
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:21,460
If I succeed, will you spare my life?

127
00:09:23,940 --> 00:09:24,940
The drought is destined.

128
00:09:25,620 --> 00:09:27,980
You cannot change it.

129
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:30,279
I am a Golden Core Master.

130
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:32,639
If I do my utmost,
I can definitely summon the rain.

131
00:09:34,940 --> 00:09:36,240
Alright, see for yourself.

132
00:10:20,482 --> 00:10:24,073
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

133
00:10:24,073 --> 00:10:26,860
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

134
00:10:27,436 --> 00:10:29,598
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

135
00:10:29,598 --> 00:10:32,444
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

136
00:10:32,444 --> 00:10:35,722
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

137
00:10:35,722 --> 00:10:37,356
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

138
00:10:37,356 --> 00:10:39,420
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

139
00:10:39,420 --> 00:10:40,956
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

140
00:10:40,956 --> 00:10:43,738
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

141
00:10:44,187 --> 00:10:46,092
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

142
00:10:46,092 --> 00:10:52,123
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

143
00:10:52,705 --> 00:10:56,588
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

144
00:10:56,588 --> 00:10:59,813
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

145
00:11:00,325 --> 00:11:02,924
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

146
00:11:02,924 --> 00:11:08,052
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

147
00:11:08,052 --> 00:11:11,580
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

148
00:11:11,580 --> 00:11:15,288
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

149
00:11:15,288 --> 00:11:17,180
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

150
00:11:17,180 --> 00:11:19,257
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

151
00:11:19,257 --> 00:11:21,788
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

152
00:11:21,788 --> 00:11:25,825
♪You met the most precious person♪

153
00:11:27,493 --> 00:11:29,356
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

154
00:11:29,356 --> 00:11:31,875
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

155
00:11:31,875 --> 00:11:33,324
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

156
00:11:33,324 --> 00:11:35,626
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

157
00:11:35,626 --> 00:11:37,596
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

158
00:11:37,596 --> 00:11:42,006
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

159
00:11:42,006 --> 00:11:43,548
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

160
00:11:43,548 --> 00:11:45,458
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

161
00:11:45,458 --> 00:11:48,732
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

162
00:11:48,732 --> 00:11:52,053
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

163
00:11:52,053 --> 00:11:53,788
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

164
00:11:53,788 --> 00:11:58,412
♪Just catch your breath first♪

165
00:11:58,412 --> 00:12:02,162
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

166
00:12:02,162 --> 00:12:05,540
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

167
00:12:05,914 --> 00:12:07,884
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

168
00:12:07,884 --> 00:12:13,631
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

169
00:12:13,631 --> 00:12:17,147
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

170
00:12:17,147 --> 00:12:18,716
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

171
00:12:18,716 --> 00:12:21,026
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

172
00:12:21,026 --> 00:12:22,764
♪From laughter to devotion♪

173
00:12:22,764 --> 00:12:24,820
♪From falling to innocence♪

174
00:12:24,820 --> 00:12:26,668
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

175
00:12:26,668 --> 00:12:33,338
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
